# Methodology

This project analyzes a simulated ransomware incident using safe, public forensic datasets.

## Environment
- macOS host
- VirtualBox Windows VM (offline)
- Tools:
  - Wireshark
  - Autopsy
  - Plaso/log2timeline

## Workflow
1. PCAP network analysis (Wireshark)
2. Disk artifact analysis (Autopsy)
3. Correlate events (Plaso)
4. Test recovery artifacts (shadow copies, metadata)
5. Document findings
6. Build presentation
